rule late_flag v1
description "Flags a return as late from the day it is due, which may be missing. The second row takes every value, the absent one too, so it meets the row for a return with no day"

inputs
  due : date?  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-12-31

outputs
  late : bool

table pick
policy unique
| due  | -> late : bool |
| none | false          |
| -    | true           |
